Project: bboxy450-term — https://github.com/bboxy450/bboxy450-term
Task: `tasks/2026-10-31-toolkit-widgets.md` (#50), harness KB.
Executor: E2 toolkit-widgets, Boxy <bboxy450@gmail.com>.
